#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR_TOOLSET.rst:2
msgid "CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR_TOOLSET"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR_TOOLSET.rst:4
msgid ""
"Specify the CTest ``CMakeGeneratorToolset`` setting in "
"a :manual:`ctest(1)` :ref:`Dashboard Client` script, or on "
"the :program:`ctest` command line via the :ctest-dashboard-option:`-D` "
"option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR_TOOLSET.rst:8
msgid ""
"The :command:`ctest_configure` command passes this value "
"to :manual:`cmake(1)` with the :cmake-option:`-T` option "
"when :variable:`CTEST_CONFIGURE_COMMAND` is not set.  "
"See :variable:`CMAKE_GENERATOR_TOOLSET` for the values supported by each "
"generator."
msgstr ""
